---
import NavigationBar from "../../components/NavigationBar.astro";
import Chapter from "../../components/writing/Chapter.astro";
import Paragraph from "../../components/writing/Paragraph.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import MainView from "../../layouts/MainView.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div class="flex flex-inital justify-center">
        <MainView>
            <NavigationBar />
            <Chapter>About Me</Chapter>
            <Paragraph>
                Hi, I am Mubin Muhammad(screen name, <i>mubin-thinks</i>),
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                I'm currently a high-school student with interest in Software
                Engineering/Development, I have a good grasp on The C Programming Language
                and basics of C++. In the past, I had interest in Graphics Programming and
                learned the basics of OpenGL, with which I have created a small Game &
                Image Processor in C++.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                Apart from working on small projects, I focus on Competitve Programming &
                Participating in Contests. Though I'm currently below-average in this
                category and thus taking it more seriously.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                I also look into web-development technologies. Though, this side rapidly
                changes in a short time, I have a few that I like, namely SolidJS & Astro
                because they are one of the lightweight and fast UI Library & Framework
                respectively. I also appreciate React, Preact, Alpine.js, Svelte & more.
            </Paragraph>

            <Chapter>My Current Task</Chapter>
            <Paragraph>
                At the time of writing, my focus is primarily on Competitive Programming
                and the upcoming IOI(International Olympiad in Informatics) 2027.
            </Paragraph>
        </MainView>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>